-Right.

262
00:11:47,199 --> 00:11:48,400
It's a picture of a bunny.

263
00:11:48,466 --> 00:11:51,199
I don't care how great it is,
and it is great, and the guy is great,

264
00:11:51,300 --> 00:11:53,933
and it's great, and I'm sure
it's worth every penny.

265
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,933
