-Yeah.

266
00:11:56,033 --> 00:11:58,533
What did he do? Tell me what he did?
I'll tell you what he did.

267
00:11:58,633 --> 00:12:01,300
He said, "I think I'm gonna make
this great picture of a bunny.

268
00:12:01,366 --> 00:12:03,633
