274
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:16,300
-He's an artist. Doesn't meet with people.
-Right.

275
00:12:16,733 --> 00:12:19,633
'Cause he's got no defense either
for the fact that it's

276
00:12:19,672 --> 00:12:21,774
-this much money for a picture of a bunny.
-Totally.

277
00:12:21,866 --> 00:12:23,400
He's afraid I might say,

278
00:12:24,100 --> 00:12:26,633
-"It's just a bunny. Come on."
-"It's a picture of a bunny."

279
00:12:27,066 --> 00:12:28,066
"I know."

280
00:12:29,566 --> 00:12:30,466
"Right?"

281
00:12:30,883 --> 00:12:34,120
-"Thank you for your visit."
-"Yes. Let me get back in my..."

