-Don't care.

295
00:13:03,866 --> 00:13:05,633
We don't care, they don't care.
Nobody cares.

296
00:13:06,599 --> 00:13:08,766
You think that affects the baklava
in any way?

297
00:13:09,188 --> 00:13:11,157
-Delicious. Come on.
-It's delicious.

298
00:13:11,223 --> 00:13:13,492
Olives, the feta cheese,
it's all the same.

299
00:13:13,566 --> 00:13:17,699
I love how the Greeks are like,
"Okay, give us some more money,

300
00:13:17,766 --> 00:13:20,000
we're really gonna buckle down."

301
00:13:21,667 --> 00:13:23,536
