will be here available.

311
00:13:49,266 --> 00:13:50,666
-"And we hope you come back."
-Yeah.

312
00:13:51,033 --> 00:13:52,666
-"And if you don't--"
-No problem.

313
00:13:53,165 --> 00:13:54,567
-"We'd love to see you."
-Yeah.

314
00:13:54,933 --> 00:13:56,866
"But if you can't make it, we get it."

315
